{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/ProofInstInfo.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.getProofInstInfoOfExpr?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">getProofInstInfoOfExpr?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SymM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.SymM\">SymM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SymM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.ProofInstInfo\">ProofInstInfo</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns information about which arguments of the function `e` are proofs or instances, see\n`getProofInstInfo?` and `getProofInstInfoOfFVar?`. Returns `none` if `e` is neither a constant\nnor a local declaration.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/ProofInstInfo.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.getProofInstInfoOfExpr?","kind":"def","line":83,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.getProofInstInfoOfExpr?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/ProofInstInfo.lean#L83-L92"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/ProofInstInfo.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.getProofInstInfoOfFVar?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">getProofInstInfoOfFVar?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">fvarId</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.FVarId\">FVarId</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SymM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.SymM\">SymM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SymM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.ProofInstInfo\">ProofInstInfo</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns information about the type of the local declaration `fvarId`. It contains information about\nwhich arguments are proofs or instances. Returns `none` if no arguments are proofs or instances.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/ProofInstInfo.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.getProofInstInfoOfFVar?","kind":"def","line":71,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.getProofInstInfoOfFVar?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/ProofInstInfo.lean#L71-L81"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/ProofInstInfo.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.getProofInstInfo?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">getProofInstInfo?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">declName</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SymM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.SymM\">SymM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SymM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.ProofInstInfo\">ProofInstInfo</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns information about the type signature of `declName`. It contains information about which arguments\nare proofs or instances. Returns `none` if no arguments are proofs or instances.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/ProofInstInfo.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.getProofInstInfo?","kind":"def","line":59,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.getProofInstInfo?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7